  "description": "Flower Pinky is a sweet, playful, and charming handwritten script font designed to bring warmth, joy, and a touch of romance to your creative projects!\nFeaturing smooth curves, thick friendly strokes, and cute heart-shaped details (like the dot on the letter ‘i’), Flower Pinky is perfect for giving any design a handcrafted, feminine, and delightful feel.\nWhether you’re creating adorable merchandise, romantic greeting cards, or eye-catching social media graphics, this font adds an instant splash of sweetness!",
